n you got to be attentive to  detail you have to really be focused on  the process um and and you can't just  show up on sunday and think that uh it's  gonna be easy um you gotta know uh what  you're gonna get yourself into uh that  week um you gotta prepare and then on  game day you gotta bring your best up uh  he's he's a great player he's a  game-changing uh corner by the way that  he makes plays at the bottom here uh i  i've known him for a long time because  of his older brother so um we'll be  interested in competing against him but  uh we'll be good to see him i'm curious  you mentioned earlier in the interview  that you're just kind of cooking at home  and you're watching some of the games on  sunday on this bye week you know when  you're watching nfl games what are you  are you relaxed or what's your thought  process and the particular games you're  keeping an eye on for  yeah i'm super relaxed i get to just  watch as a fan um you know  people always ask you know do you do you  use it as you know study film uh do you  you know do you actually scout teams  you're gonna be playing the next few  weeks and i used to as a young player i  used to be like all right the packers  are playing tonight um i'm gonna watch  them because we play them next week and  uh you know try to you know get against  an advanced scout on them but on tv you  just can't see it well enough to even  temper to even matter so uh for me i  just watch as a fan and then when i when  i want to do my study i can go on the  ipad and i can get a better look there  but uh it's fun to just kind of take  yourself out of it and just watch from a  different perspective that's awesome i  love it well i have to talk about your  foundation because you guys are doing  amazing work at the phelan foundation  recently hosting an event uh with top  golf this foundation focuses on using  the power of sport to change society so  adam can you share a little bit more  about your foundation and why it's so  important to you  yeah my wife and i um we have a special  place in our heart for youth um and  specifically youth um you know kids and  um that really don't have the resources  opportunities uh that we had growing up  that really helped us be able to play  high school sports to be able to go on  to college so  really just  helping provide those opportunities  resources  to these kids and to really just kind of  bring those communities around them the  last thing that we were able to do  recently was provide lights for a high  school football team and uh well really  a high school you know they can play  soccer under their football and to be  able to see the community be able to  come out there and support them for the  first time in a long time uh they've  been without lights and and they've had  to play games at three o'clock and their  families weren't able to come the  community wasn't able to come and just  to be able to see  that community support and how that  changes those kids mentality  is really really special and obviously  a great community here that is  supportive of these different tasks um  the people that do have the resources  they're really all on board of helping  us and really changing these communities  um that means so much to my wife and i  well adam is truly admirable to see what  you and caitlin are doing there off the  field it's been fun to watch you on the  field this season as well and we'll look  forward to seeing you again on sunday  night football against the cowboys the  good luck next week thanks so much for  taking the time to join us  yeah thank you so much appreciate it  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

